   "key": "func TrendComparisonCard.trendAverages(_:)",
   "hash": "ac603969fdc0294b",
   "does": "Averages: RMSSD = exp(baseline lnRmssdMean) else arithmetic mean; HR = baseline meanHRBaseline else arithmetic mean; stress/readiness arithmetic means or nil; baselines from baselineStats; stress baseline nil; 7-day trend from TrendVerdict.weeklyRMSSDChange.",
   "entry": null,
